OL,3,GNEWSATown hall repairs reduce Raac
OL,4,Arisks, says council
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe risk posed by reinforced autoclaved
OL,7,Faerated concrete (Raac) to a town hall
OL,8,Fhas been significantly reduced
OL,9,Ffollowing repairs, a city council said.
OL,11,FThe mitigation work to Peterborough
OL,12,FTown Hall, which is expected to cost
OL,13,F#900,000, was approved by Peterborough
OL,14,FCity Council's cabinet in July 2025.
OL,16,FAt the time, the authority said the
OL,17,Frisk of the roof collapsing was
OL,18,Funlikely, but acknowledged the
OL,19,Fconsequences could be severe if it did.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
