OL,5,
OL,6,FMohammed Jamil, the authority's cabinet
OL,7,Fmember for finance and corporate
OL,8,Fgovernance, said: "We have completed
OL,9,Fphase one of the works to heavily
OL,10,Freduce the risk of any Raac damage.
